{
  "id": 119496577,
  "iid": 4422,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "GREbond: Add support for Huawei's GRE bonding (RFC8157) control protocol",
  "description": "This MR adds a new dissector. It is for the control messages of the GRE bonding protocol by Huawei (RFC8157). These messages are encapsulated in GRE and can appear on both/all bonding links.\n\nDuring first development, I made use of traffic for Deutsche Telekom Hybrid service. There fore, it also supports the first versions which did not have an IEEE assigned ethertype.",
