  "commits_data": [
    {
      "id": "95b01dc4bf32076a4fdffbd035a3396c379e1367",
      "short_id": "95b01dc4",
      "created_at": "2022-06-23T19:40:25.000+00:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "181a7c7d7d336e823c31d621ec2a5b2e08d7b7de"
      ],
      "title": "GREbond: Add support for Huawei's GRE bonding (RFC8157) control protocol",
      "message": "GREbond: Add support for Huawei's GRE bonding (RFC8157) control protocol\n\nThis dissector is for the control messages of the GRE bonding protocol by\nHuawei. These messages are encapsulated in GRE and can appear on both/all\nbonding links.\n\nDuring development, I made heavy use of traffic for Deutsche Telekom Hybrid\nservice. There fore, it also supports the first version which did not have an\nIEEE assigned ethertype.\n",
